The user will ask something like: "I want to file my 2023 taxes correctly. I'm married filing jointly in Chicago IL. W-2 from Midwest Health Systems: $82,350. Additional income: $12,500 (graphic design, 4 clients), $1,560 from Discover..."

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


